Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.48,0:00:05.31,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't care what's going on\NWe're still looking at the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're still looking at the time.\NWe're still looking at the end of the game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still looking at\Nthe end of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.60,0:00:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, it's now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the beginning of the story.\NIt's the moment that we've been in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's rewind a little bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.52,0:01:36.49,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,478)\pos(151,850)}Episode 32: Set's Alessi, Part 1 {Japanese pronounciation is "Seto" which is Set, but from what I can see Seto-shin is always romanized as "Sethan" (even in the card in this episode)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Joseph and Avdol were battling\NMariah, Jotaro and Polnareff were.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here's your drink, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.04,0:01:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A super-duper-tall glass of whiskey\Nand soda on the rocks. Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, somebody's dying to quench\Nyour thirst early this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scandalous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:01:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darling, how you do go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.44,0:02:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My husband's gone away on a business\Ntrip and won't return for another week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, how about\Nenjoying a piece of cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't trouble yourself, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.24,0:02:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kids are great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.90,0:02:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's almost 9 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man and Avdol\Nare taking way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may have had a run-in with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we should see\Nwhere they ran off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go, Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.38,0:02:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Iggy, where in the world\Ndo you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what a stupid mutt. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make some room, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to play, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way we'd ever play\Nwith a jerk like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:02:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are the jerks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, that really hurt.
