Dialogue: 2,0:03:19.92,0:03:19.97,SFX,3,0,0,0,,{=10}{\bord0\blur0.7\fade(255,0,255,-3290,-3289,49,50)\frz3.815\org(41.232,22.767)\pos(41.232,22.767)\4a&HFF&}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't shed a single tear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, kid, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four years old, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.56,0:03:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about your daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, he's at work. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your daddy's at work, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where's your mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's at home doing laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you came here all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.42,0:04:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's no one around to stop me from
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bashing your face and\Nfor ruining my pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna pay to get the mud cleaned off?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.80,0:04:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're gonna get a job\Nfor the cash to pay me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you think I have years\Nto wait for some little punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to work his way through debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little shit stain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph and Avdol are in the middle\Nof doing battle with Mariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I, Alessi, shall take on the great\Nhonor of killing Jotaro and Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're tenacious to be sure, but I'll\Ndo whatever it takes to achieve victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy, Alessi. Alessi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enemy's name, Alessi. Stand. Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God of storms and chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Favorite phrase, attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, keep your guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten who you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and Avdol already left,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't really look\Nlike there was a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.74,0:05:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, Avdol, you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, I'm starting to\Nget a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let me have a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, just leave me some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ducked with my sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get back in this\Ninstant, you mangy fleabag!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you think I have nowhere to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys truly haven't\Nrealized it yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only thought you were hunting me when
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really I was luring you\Nhere the entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're going\Nto fry this time, Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you should run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.80,0:06:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.30,0:06:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adol might be able to defend himself\Nfor now with his place, but not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:06:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die, Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goddess Bast is the perfect trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's also far more powerful\Nthan your Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.44,0:07:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
