Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dropped my change.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd lose my own head if it\Nwasn't attached to my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you're following us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already see the evil in\Nyour eyes, so don't lie. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry, my good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I understand\Nwhat you meant by evil eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My loving non-evil parents\Ngave me these baby blues.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the change I was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easy to prove that\Nyou're not a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you really are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I was right and you are a stand user.
