Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's running?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro! It's the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hot on his trail!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:08:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.66,0:09:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he be so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, he's already so far ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my voice? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is up with my shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're ginormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know running around in the\Nstreet like that can get you hurt or worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.74,0:09:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I wasn't the front\Nend of some out-of-control car.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.08,0:09:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go and lecture someone\Nelse with that big mouth of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:09:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of chasing someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.19,0:10:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really high up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.40,0:10:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lifting me up with one arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how tall is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.18,0:10:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His face and hands are huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's a giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, listen here,\Nyou pine-sized pissant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you\Nto go around shooting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your ignorant little mouth\Noff to adults that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're a big man just because\Nyou're playing dress-up in adult clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Annoying, good-for-nothing brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does everyone look like giants?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been turned into a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.14,0:11:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is something like\Nthis happening to me?
