Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this really be happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no possible way\Nthis kid could really be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned into a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be his stance power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That creeper must have found a way to put\Na curse on me during our fight earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a sneaking suspicion it happened\Nwhen his shadow stand lunged at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I let him do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.76,0:12:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, this is bad, this is really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, uh, Joe, uh, no, Jay,\NJackie, uh, what was his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember his name, but\NI know this guy, he can help me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why can't I remember it,\Nwhy can't I remember his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, little boy, you, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't happen to see a French\Nguy come through here, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's about yay tall, and he's\Ngot the exact same haircut as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're talking about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.84,0:12:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.75,0:12:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asking a kid was an awful idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold on!
