Dialogue: 2,0:13:10.68,0:13:10.72,SFX - Copy,8,0,0,0,,{=13}{\bord0\blur0.6\fade(255,0,255,-10970,-10969,49,50)\frz356.7\org(1875.756,34.488)\pos(1875.756,34.488)\4a&HFF&}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't seriously be able to erase\Neverything I knew as an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all becoming a blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's about time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love picking on the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy, Alessi. Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away, you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.56,0:13:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say this too loudly, but picking\Non the weak really gets me going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.68,0:13:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be a bit sick in the head,\Nbut hey, c 'est la vie, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like everyone says if you think\Nyou're a little loony upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there's a good chance\Nyou're probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my confirmation\Nthat I'm totally sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can't imagine how good it feels\Nto know that I'll never lose to some kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever your name is, you have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you no doubt know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my mission is to wipe\Nyou and your good-for
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-nothing cohorts from\Nthe face of the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't\Nhave time to savor the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:14:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have expected as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems you were able to\Nsummon your stand as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how strong is this stupid stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Silver Chariot is a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's just as weak as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He bent a sword blocking those bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand set reverted you\Nback to your childhood state?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that all of your mental\Nabilities were reverted right along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand has gone back to a child stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the form it had before you two\Nwere fully attuned to each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, it seems like you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.86,0:15:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atta boy, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.04,0:15:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, as weak as it is, your\Nstand is still at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I shall use my stand\Nfor your execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die, Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It broke in jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little boy, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that guy runs for the hills as\Nsoon as there's another adult around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm safe for now, but that\Nfreak was off his rocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't run off, little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're hurt. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:16:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:16:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh, well, the thing is, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you mumbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.52,0:17:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those wounds need to be treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me to my\Nhouse and I'll fix you up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't defeat the stand user,\NI won't turn back into an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the past is any indication, he\Nwon't attack me with this lady around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use that time to think of a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hurt. So climb on my back,\Nbut make sure you hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hurts like a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that little crotch sniffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to take this\Nfrom a snot-nosed kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll pay dearly for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll butcher that brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things, he\Ndoesn't seem to be coming after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.22,0:18:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, little boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're going to take a bath, so let's\Ntake those clothes off, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're completely covered in grime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll clean those wounds up\Nand put some medicine on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you staring at, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.44,0:18:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better yet, I'll take them off for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, raise your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:18:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It most definitely is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.30,0:19:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I get the feeling that I should\Nbe really embarrassed about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if my...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so small.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but for\Nsome reason that makes me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cry. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we get all that dirt off of\Nyou, you'll be as good as new again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, lift your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you positive it's okay\Nfor me to touch you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's okay, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't clean up those\Nwounds, they could get infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got dirt on your wee-wee too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:19:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:20:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain why, but I'm\Njust so happy all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's all part of being a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You be a good boy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fool's delirious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your stupor while you can, because\NI'm going to chop your face in tow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could you be grinning\Nabout, you silly boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I think it's time\Nwe wash your hair. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate using shampoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:20:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gets into my eyes and I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey, monkey, do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.38,0:21:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, sit still!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it sting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it stings a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you wash your hair\Nall by yourself? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not as good as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, attaboy.
